And I'm Angela Kinsey.

121
00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.730
We were on The Office together.

122
00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:10.970
And we're best friends.

123
00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:14.810
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.

124
00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:19.010
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind the

125
00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:21.790
scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.

126
00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:22.930
We're The Office ladies.

127
00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.060
Hello, everyone.

128
00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.280
Howdy.

129
00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:33.900
Today, we are breaking down Goodbye, Toby, part one.

130
00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.620
I can't believe it.

131
00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:36.800
