00:54:11.860 --> 00:54:13.080
Michael Scott on The Office.

1282
00:54:13.180 --> 00:54:19.560
And it is a tragedy because this scene, this scene of him, he is so wired.

1283
00:54:19.740 --> 00:54:22.560
He says, I laid a base.

1284
00:54:22.740 --> 00:54:23.580
I laid a base.

1285
00:54:23.820 --> 00:54:25.640
And even though I wanted to kiss her, I didn't.

1286
00:54:26.120 --> 00:54:27.860
I mean, it's such good acting.

1287
00:54:28.020 --> 00:54:28.500
It's so good.

1288
00:54:29.040 --> 00:54:29.580
All of it.

1289
00:54:29.760 --> 00:54:30.100
I know.

1290
00:54:31.360 --> 00:54:37.640
Well, Phyllis now is going to go over to Angela and admit that she needs some help with the

1291
00:54:37.640 --> 00:54:38.260
party planning.

1292
00:54:38.440 --> 00:54:40.860
She's going to need the vendors that Angela has.

1293
00:54:41.000 --> 00:54:42.900
All the lists, all the phone numbers, right?

1294
00:54:42.900 --> 00:54:43.700
You know what?

1295
00:54:43.900 --> 00:54:46.040
You know what just happened to that vendor list?

1296
00:54:47.620 --> 00:54:49.300
Oh, someone shredded it.

1297
00:54:49.640 --> 00:54:50.280
Just now.

1298
00:54:50.920 --> 00:54:53.080
And Phyllis is like, why would you do that?

1299
00:54:53.080 --> 00:54:56.600
And Angela says, hmm, why do you think?

1300
00:54:57.240 --> 00:54:58.780
Yeah, I just don't know.

1301
00:54:59.500 --> 00:55:00.580
So good, Angela.

1302
00:55:00.720 --> 00:55:02.140
You're so good in that scene.

1303
00:55:02.940 --> 00:55:07.120
And then Phyllis knocks the papers off of Angela's desk.

1304
00:55:07.360 --> 00:55:08.920
I have two things to share.

1305
00:55:09.060 --> 00:55:11.640
First of all, that whole scene was in the script.

1306
00:55:11.900 --> 00:55:14.660
And Phyllis knocking the papers off the desk.

1307
00:55:14.660 --> 00:55:16.400
I wanted to see if that was in the script.

1308
00:55:16.600 --> 00:55:17.220
It was.

1309
00:55:17.400 --> 00:55:19.400
So that was all written out.

1310
00:55:19.660 --> 00:55:21.600
But I wanted to share something with you guys.

1311
00:55:21.900 --> 00:55:27.240
I remember when we rehearsed the scene, because you know, you guys, we would rehearse for camera

1312
00:55:27.240 --> 00:55:30.480
so they would know where to line up their shots, right?

1313
00:55:31.400 --> 00:55:34.260
When Phyllis said to me in the rehearsal, can I get a list of your vendors?

1314
00:55:34.540 --> 00:55:38.200
I'm supposed to bend over quickly, hold the basket up and say, I shredded it.

1315
00:55:38.400 --> 00:55:40.020
There was no quickly about it.

1316
00:55:40.140 --> 00:55:41.240
I was very pregnant.

1317
00:55:41.540 --> 00:55:44.400
I couldn't reach the basket they said on the ground easily.

1318
00:55:44.400 --> 00:55:48.900
So I was like, and then they're like, okay, that's not going to do.

1319
00:55:49.060 --> 00:55:52.120
We can't see you struggling to reach the garbage bin, right?

1320
00:55:52.900 --> 00:55:58.240
So Matt Sohn, who was so sweet, who was our camera operator, he was like, let's just set

1321
00:55:58.240 --> 00:55:59.300
it on an Apple box.

1322
00:55:59.420 --> 00:56:00.280
You won't see it.

1323
00:56:00.320 --> 00:56:03.880
So Angela doesn't have to bend all the way down to the floor.

1324
00:56:04.240 --> 00:56:08.440
So if you watch the scene, I have that basket so ready to go.

1325
00:56:08.680 --> 00:56:10.640
It's because I don't even have to bend over to reach it.

1326
00:56:10.740 --> 00:56:11.280
It's right there.

1327
00:56:12.060 --> 00:56:14.000
Yes, I was very pregnant, guys.

1328
00:56:14.360 --> 00:56:17.920
This is something that comes up for Jenna and I as we rewatch these episodes.

1329
00:56:18.020 --> 00:56:21.100
There's real life that meets the fiction, right?

1330
00:56:21.100 --> 00:56:26.020
All of the memories of what you had to go through to make these scenes work.

1331
00:56:26.420 --> 00:56:29.040
To pick up a trash bin when you're super pregnant.

1332
00:56:30.080 --> 00:56:36.060
Well, now we cut back to Michael and Holly's kind of still working on the chair and Toby

1333
00:56:36.060 --> 00:56:39.040
