1334
00:56:39.200 --> 00:56:41.900
He's like, why don't you go home and come back for the party?

1335
00:56:42.160 --> 00:56:45.960
But Toby says, well, we still have to do my exit interview.

1336
00:56:48.260 --> 00:56:52.020
All right, guys, Michael has a talking head.

1337
00:56:52.260 --> 00:56:56.280
He says he's been steeped in anticipation of this moment.

1338
00:56:56.800 --> 00:57:01.160
Toby has been, quote, cruising for a bruising for 12 years.

1339
00:57:01.400 --> 00:57:04.600
And my name is Captain Bruising.

1340
00:57:05.420 --> 00:57:08.900
The look on Michael's face says it all.

1341
00:57:09.060 --> 00:57:12.920
He has been waiting for this moment for a long time.

1342
00:57:12.920 --> 00:57:14.340
And he can't wait.

1343
00:57:14.580 --> 00:57:17.320
I'm sorry to tell you that we're going to stop here.

1344
00:57:19.100 --> 00:57:21.900
You will have to wait for this exit interview.

1345
00:57:22.220 --> 00:57:26.920
It's how we will start out next week with Goodbye, Toby Part 2.

1346
00:57:27.680 --> 00:57:29.040
It's so good.

1347
00:57:29.320 --> 00:57:31.300
Oh, I loved this episode.

